---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Support — Field Notes"
  description="How to support the writing on Field Notes."
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p>
      Everything on this site stays free to read. If a post saved you a week of work, here is the
      way to say thanks.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>One-off support</h2>
    <p>You set the amount. No PayPal account needed — card, Apple Pay or PayPal balance.</p>
    <form action="https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/8AWFEHFET7ESU" method="post" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <p><button class="donate" type="submit">Support with PayPal</button></p>
    </form>
    <p class="tiny">Opens on paypal.com in a new tab.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>What your support pays for</h2>
    <p>
      Nothing here is paywalled, and nothing will be. Support covers the domain, the hosting,
      and the hours that go into the task books and scripts behind each post — the parts that
      take weeks and are not visible in the published text.
    </p>

    <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
    <p>
      Reading, arguing with the method in the comments where the post is discussed, and sending
      the post to one person who needs it — all of that moves this further than a tip does.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Newsletter />
</Base>
